      "row_id": "4c483cb9ca35ff4092e105850fa1ccd48d434380c918afcb981ecf44c8e357fe:000002_488355142422993287:g0:r7",
      "row_index_0based": 7,
      "serialized_row_index": 7,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "負のオーラを纏った凶のおみくじを主人公たちに\n投げつけてきたおみくじ２０２４。\n主人公たちは慌ててそれを避ける。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "b6721c7eae39d0305fc7b0b21a9e12914613ad20f0f85b1bbd21c8e03f8ed98e",
